See also ((Currently proposed experimental cmavo)).

;__((cau'e))__ (Was Footnote:  ((COI) )) vocative: comforting noise made toward infants (suggested by ((Jordan DeLong)))
* ((And|I)) think ''ki'ai'' + some appropriate sound would be more appropriate here, in that it it is a solution that generalizes to other quasi-vocatives.
