;__((xoi))__ (Was Footnote:  ((ROI) )): means the same as (( JAhA + CAI|ja'axi )), discovered in [http://lojban.org/publications/reference_grammar/chapter19.html#e6d12|the book] after I (((xod))) invented ((xoi)).
